    news: [["Launch", "AGENT DIMENSION is open to everyone", "Choose your AI agent — AURORA, ORION or VEX — in the Genesis Lab at the Nexus Infinity Citadel. Launch week: 100,000 $ARCIRCLE (list 200,000, 50% off). Half of every payment is burned, half goes to the treasury."], ["Preview", "Nexus City: AGENT DIMENSION's own city", "A futuristic city behind the Citadel: six landmark buildings, a raised ring highway, flying cars, agents visibly at work, a job board — and ARCIRCLE Studio Lite, where you make your own games. Opening with AGENT DIMENSION."], ["New", "A coin in the fountain, a welcome back, and what's on next", "Toss a coin in the plaza fountain once a day (10 ARCL), see what's coming up on the clock, pick your hero while the world loads, and come back to where you left off."], ["New", "A brighter arrival on the plaza", "A clearer loading screen with the games' own art, a beam of light as you land, a welcome for first-timers, a fountain that dances to the music, glowing portals and light lines that lead you to them."], ["New", "A smoother first minute", "The loading bar tells you what it's doing, all three heroes fit on a phone, the buttons wait until you're ready, and three short cards show how to move, jump and fight."], ["Poker", "Poker: badges, today's rule, a tutorial", "Your last 20 hands to replay and share, 12 badges, a daily rule with its own board, a 3-hand tutorial with ARCIA, AI players with personalities, looks for chips, crew tables and blackjack side bets."], ["New", "The Launchpad Village & the Utility Village", "Every coin launched on ArcPad now has its own lot in a village of its own — bigger with its market cap. The utilities have their own village too, and portals on the plaza take you there."],["Poker", "Poker: Sit & Go every 2 hours", "Scheduled Sit & Go tournaments, one-tap bets, early moves, players walking the lounge, emotes and spectators — the ARCIA Poker Lounge levels up."], ["Halloween", "The Pumpkin Kings are here", "Five dancing Pumpkin Kings by day — Inferno Jack rampaging at night (US Eastern). Top 3 hitters win ARCL and gear; Lv 95: 30,000 ARCL + Jack's Inferno Blade."], ["Partners", "Partner Village is live: first gameplay", "Walk into the KAIRO Finance Hub — Swap, KLIK & Disperse — with an AI agent exploring alongside us. Four more plots wait for partners."], ["Partners", "Partner Village opens today", "Our ecosystem partners' own buildings and utilities in the world — the first, the KAIRO Tower: Swap, KLIK and Disperse."], ["Partnership", "ARCIRCLE WORLD × KAIRO: official partnership", "KAIRO Finance Hub in the world, Swap & KLIK for $ARCIRCLE, and Disperse for on-chain rewards."], ["Jurassic", "Jurassic Gets Wilder", "Enraged bosses, PERFECT dodges, the Whispering Mire, fossil digs, storms, meteor showers, taming and hunting together."], ["AGENT DIMENSION", "AGENT DIMENSION: meet AURORA, ORION and VEX", "As long as we're building on Arc, you'll have three AI agents to choose from. More details soon."], ["Vision", "GAMING × AI AGENTS × WEB3", "The age of AI agents has begun. ARCIRCLE WORLD is building on Arc to bring gaming, AI agents and Web3 together in one world."], ["Day 10", "Day 10: the first 1/10 of our 100-day challenge", "Ten days of building, together — one world, eight games, an economy taking shape, and 90 more days to come."], ["Update", "Jurassic World: fights you can read", "The camera moves in while you fight, every swing shows a slash, the boss hour has a big shared HP bar — and a knock-out tells you what did it."], ["New", "The coins page: $ARCIRCLE & ARCL", "What each coin is, where to earn, spend and use it, how they connect — with live numbers from Arc and from the game."], ["New", "Creator Market & the ARCL ledger", "Sell your island blueprints for ARCL, and see every ARCL movement in your Wallet tab."], ["Update", "Jurassic World: boss hour, Ember Basin, daily missions", "Hunt the enraged boss together at 12:00 and 20:00 (KST), enter the volcanic Ember Basin, fish the lake — and three daily missions."], ["Update", "INFINITY RINGS doubles to 200 levels", "Ice, portal and timer rings, the RIFT BOSS at 200, weekly puzzles and a 60-second Time Attack."], ["Update", "SURVIVORS ARENA major update", "Reroll, Banish & Skip, the chest roulette, permanent upgrades, achievements and a daily challenge."]],
    feats: [["🌍", "One world, many games", "Eight games and a town to explore, all in one connected world."], ["💠", "Earn ARCL as you play", "In-game points for taking part, with daily limits. Exchange ARCL ⇄ $ARCIRCLE by request."], ["👛", "One wallet", "The same wallet, USDC and $ARCIRCLE as ARCIRCLE PAD. Play as a guest first."], ["🏝️", "Build your island", "A brick builder up to 36×36 (LAND owners 64×64), styles and a village score."], ["🤝", "Better together", "Chat, friends, crews, hunting parties and weekly bounties."], ["🦖", "Pets & dinosaurs", "Hatch pets and dinosaurs. Adult dinos fight beside you — and you can ride them."], ["⚔️", "An RPG at heart", "Level 1–500, gear in seven slots, a forge, and a weekly raid boss."], ["📱", "Phone & PC", "Runs in the browser, no download. English, 한국어, 中文 and Türkçe."]],
    steps: [["Press PLAY FREE", "The world opens in your browser. No download, no sign-up."], ["Make your hero", "Pick ARON, LUMI or NEX, a colour and a name."], ["Learn the moves", "Walk, jump, try the Launchpad, and knock out the training scammer."], ["Save & play", "Sign in with your wallet to keep your progress and earn ARCL — then open the Games list."]],
