    events: [["🎃", "Halloween: the Pumpkin Kings", "Five dancing kings by day; at night they rampage as Inferno Jack (Lv 15–95). Top 3 hitters win ARCL and gear.", "22 Oct – 5 Nov · nights 20:00–05:00 US Eastern"], ["🔥", "Weekend 2×", "Double XP and double ARCL from play.", "Sat–Sun (KST)"], ["📅", "Daily check-in", "Come back every day for your check-in reward.", "Every day"], ["🎁", "Launch gift & welcome week", "New players open a launch gift box and get a week of welcome rewards.", "New players"], ["🐉", "Weekly raid boss", "Team up against the week's raid boss in town.", "Every week"], ["♾️", "Infinity Rings daily puzzles", "Three puzzles for everyone. All three at 3 stars: +300 ARCL bonus.", "Every day"], ["⚔️", "Survivors daily challenge", "The same seed for everyone, a twist each day and its own board.", "Every day"], ["🃏", "Poker Opening Festival", "+50% chips on your first purchase in the lounge.", "Opening"], ["🏝️", "Weekly island contest", "Show off your island and vote for the best one of the week.", "Every week"], ["🛡️", "Daily scam quiz", "Learn to spot crypto scams — one quick quiz a day.", "Every day"]],
    notices: [["AGENT DIMENSION is open: choose your AI agent", "Every player can now make an agent (AURORA, ORION or VEX) in the Genesis Lab. Launch price 100,000 $ARCIRCLE (list 200,000), paid from your wallet on Arc; 50% is burned and 50% goes to the treasury. ARCIRCLE Studio is open to everyone too."], ["Nexus City preview: the city, agents at work, Studio Lite", "A futuristic city for AGENT DIMENSION behind the Citadel (six buildings, ring highway, flying cars); agents seen at work and a job board that runs errands while you're away; ARCIRCLE Studio Lite to make, test and publish Sky Runner games. Team-only for now — opens with AGENT DIMENSION."], ["The fountain coin, what's on next, welcome back", "A daily coin in the plaza fountain (10 ARCL, server-checked), the next events at the top of the screen, a welcome-back card with 'Back to where I left', a loading-screen waiting room with a hero pick, the Starter title for the first 5 minutes, launch fireworks, waving town folk."], ["A brighter arrival on the plaza", "The loading screen with the games' own art, logo and tip cards; a landing beam and a first-time welcome; a dancing fountain (hourly show); glowing portals with floor light lines; hero greetings in the maker; a camera swing on start; fireflies at night; a slimmer top row on phones."], ["A smoother first minute", "Loading steps you can read, all three heroes on a phone's character maker, the buttons hidden until you start, three short how-to cards, the first quest points to a portal, and the locked skill slot says which level opens it."], ["Fixed: phones that opened the game like a computer", "Some phone browsers (\"desktop site\" mode, some wallet apps) told the game they weren't touch screens, so it opened with the computer layout: big buttons, no stick. A phone is now always recognised as a phone."], ["Poker: hand history, badges, today's rule and more", "Replay and share your last 20 hands; earn 12 badges; play today's rule (its own board); learn in 3 hands with ARCIA; card backs and felts for chips; crew-only tables and the crews' week board; Perfect Pairs and 21+3 at blackjack. Chips only — never ARCL."], ["The Launchpad Village and the Utility Village open", "Portals on the plaza take you to the new villages. Every ArcPad coin has a lot in the Launchpad Village, sized by its market cap; its creator builds it. The utilities moved to the Utility Village, as they stood."],["Poker: Sit & Go every 2 hours", "Sign up with 1,000 chips; the top 3 share the chips and poker XP, the winner earns a title. Also new: one-tap bets, early moves, lounge emotes and watchers."], ["Halloween: the Pumpkin Kings", "For two weeks, five Pumpkin Kings dance round the town. At night (20:00–05:00 US Eastern) they rampage as Inferno Jack, Lv 15–95: fight together; the top 3 hitters of each share its reward (ARCL and gear)."], ["The Partner Village opens: the KAIRO Tower", "Our official partners' own village, south-east of the plaza. Its first building, the KAIRO Tower, opens the KAIRO Finance Hub: Swap, Klik and Disperse on kairo.market."], ["AGENT DIMENSION: under construction", "The Nexus Infinity Citadel now stands east of the plaza. Your own AI agent (AURORA, ORION or VEX) opens soon — the team is testing it first."], ["Jurassic World: the Whispering Mire, taming, weather and fossils", "A third land with poison water and the Bog Stalker, taming with a bola and berries, storms and meteor showers every 2 hours, fossil dig sites and camp visits."], ["Jurassic fights: PERFECT dodge, weak spots, enraged bosses", "Jump through a bite for a PERFECT dodge. A boss share pays 200–300 ARCL and a held night raid 150 — kept small for now."], ["ARCIRCLE LAND: every village shows its island", "Each village's card, V01 to V20, now shows the full island art."], ["Fixed: the boss's HP bar and hunt errors in Jurassic World", "The boss hour shows a big shared HP bar, and a hunt the server refuses says why once instead of an error at every swing."], ["Jurassic World on a computer: a closer fight camera", "Your hero and weapon looked small on big screens. The camera now moves in while you fight, and each swing shows a slash."], ["INFINITY RINGS: levels 101–200 pay 50 ARCL a star", "Kept small while the new rings settle in. Levels 1–100 still pay 100 a star."], ["SURVIVORS ARENA: the daily challenge pays Arena Coins", "Daily challenge runs don't pay ARCL. Normal runs do: up to 3,000 a run, 3 paid runs a day."], ["ARCIRCLE LAND is open", "20 villages, paid to the ARCIRCLE treasury from your own wallet. Refunds are listed in the LAND window."]],
    policy: [["🎮", "Fair play", ["One player, one account.", "No bots, scripts, auto-clickers or exploits — rewards earned that way can be withheld.", "Found a bug? Report it instead of using it."]], ["💠", "About rewards", ["ARCL are in-game points for taking part.", "Every game has a daily limit, and amounts can change.", "Nothing is guaranteed, and nothing here is investment advice."]], ["🛡️", "Wallet safety", ["We will never ask for your seed phrase or private key.", "Signing in only signs a log-in message. Payments (like LAND) always open in your own wallet for you to approve.", "Check that you're on arcircle.app."]], ["💬", "Community", ["Be kind in chat and guestbooks.", "No scams, spam, impersonation or hate.", "Players who break the rules can be muted or removed."]]],
